Name: libde265 public API header
URL: https://github.com/strukturag/libde265
Version: 1.0.16
License: LGPL-3.0-or-later
License File: COPYING
Security Critical: yes

Only API declarations are vendored, not the decoder implementation.
Linux loads the maintained system libde265.so.0; Windows loads app-local
libde265.dll or de265.dll and its dependencies. Keep runtime libraries updated.
Local modification: removed the generated de265-version.h include; no version
macros are used. Runtime version is checked before using the decoder.
